A64. Italian central heating system. ~ ETNA
A65. Near. ~ BY
A66. Where to get a load of Minnehaha's laughing water. ~ FLASK
A67. This is chilly. ~ EERIE

D1. Egypt's li'l ray of sunshine. ~ RA
D2. The kind of fool that ought to mend his ways. ~ DARN
D3. What causes a fallen woman? ~ ICE
D4. Raw stuff the rich get away with (plur.). ~ ORES
D5. This isn't sterling but has more worth. ~ GOLD
D6. The appearance of this will officially open the picnic season. ~ ANT
D7. Thru this you see stars. ~ REEL
